@startmindmap
' Mind map for plan or ticket brainstorming: the topic in the middle, branches to the right and
' (with `left side`) to the left. Edit below the end marker. Lines are drawn by the mind-map
' engine (short elbows), not routed. Keep it to ideas; facts with sources go in the other types.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
mindmapDiagram {
  .open { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
}
</style>
' house-preamble-end

title Mind map for <plan or ticket> (as-of date)

* Replace: topic
** Replace: idea
*** Replace: detail
** Replace: idea
left side
** Replace: question <<open>>
** Replace: risk

legend bottom
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  |<#FFF3E0>| open question |
endlegend
@endmindmap
